// Title: User Account Created with a Name Ending in $
// ATT&CK: T1036.010 | Tactic: Stealth | Sigma id: c8ac9e48-1988-41d5-a9d0-92cbdaea2c93
// Data source: SecurityEvent 4720 (Windows Security Events connector)
// Severity: High
// False positives: Rare legacy tooling that creates service accounts ending in $
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = Computer, Account = SubjectUserName
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where EventID == 4720 and TargetUserName endswith "$"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, SubjectUserName, SubjectDomainName, TargetUserName, TargetDomainName
